  {
   "author": "Mohammed Sammour",
   "rating": 5,
   "when": "a month ago",
   "text": "A place to be! We love spending our weekend evenings here. The atmosphere is always warm and welcoming, with great hospitality that makes every visit enjoyable.\n\nWe especially love the Tiger Room. A special thanks to Olla (علا) for always making us feel so welcome and taking such great care of us. Highly recommended!",
   "owner_reply": null
  },
  {
   "author": "Sasha",
   "rating": 5,
   "when": "a month ago",
   "text": "The customer sevice is excellent specially from Soumaya and Souad, they are brilliant. We have been a regular customer for an year and quality of service and shisha is always amazing. I fully recommend this cafe.",
   "owner_reply": null
  },
  {
   "author": "Wajeeha Zameer",
   "rating": 5,
   "when": "a year ago",
   "text": "Review: A Hidden Gem with Great Food, Shisha, and Hospitality\n\nTucked away in a cosy corner of the city, this restaurant is a true hidden gem for anyone who appreciates good food, smooth shisha, and warm hospitality. From the moment you step inside, you’re greeted with a friendly smile and a welcoming atmosphere that makes you feel right at home.\n\nThe food is the real star here—every dish is made with care, and you can tell the ingredients are fresh. The grilled meats are perfectly cooked, tender, and full of flavour, while the mezze selection is generous and packed with authentic tastes. Whether you’re in the mood for a light bite or a full feast, there’s something on the menu to satisfy every craving.\n\nThe shisha is equally impressive—smooth, well-packed, and available in a variety of flavours. It’s clear they take pride in preparing it properly, with just the right amount of smoke and a long-lasting session that doesn’t burn out too quickly.\n\nWhat really sets this place apart, though, is the hospitality. The staff go above and beyond to ensure you’re comfortable, checking in just enough without being intrusive. They take the time to recommend dishes and make sure your shisha is always perfect, creating an experience that feels personal and genuine.\n\nWhether you're here for a relaxed evening with friends or a solo escape to unwind, this spot delivers on all fronts. It’s the kind of place you’ll find yourself returning to again and again—not just for the food and shisha, but for the warmth and care that make every visit special.",
   "owner_reply": null
  },
